[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（そうして波乱万丈な騎士実技試験を終え、\n\u3000筆記試験も終え……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(And so, after completing the tumultuous knight practical exam and the written test...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（待ちに待った結果発表の日。\n\u3000結果はもちろん……！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The long-awaited day of the results announcement. And the result was of course...!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "受かったー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I passed!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おめでとう、イザナちゃん！\n受かるって信じてたよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Congratulations, Izana! I knew you'd pass!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヨハナ、どうしたの？\n夜ご飯抜きでも宣告されたような顔してるわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna, what's wrong? You look like someone just told you there's no dinner tonight."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この私が……筆記で落ちた……？\n何が……いやあの問題？\u3000あり得ないあり得ない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Me... failed the written exam...? How... those questions? No way, absolutely no way!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だ、大丈夫？\u3000ヨハナちゃん？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A-are you okay, Johanna?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふ、ふん！\u3000まあ、騎士なんてこっちから\n願い下げっていうか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "H-hmph! Well, who needs to be a knight anyway?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "堅苦しい枠に収まるような天才じゃないし？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm too much of a genius to be confined by their rigid structure!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、そうだね！\u3000ヨハナちゃんには、\nヨハナちゃんらしい道があるもんね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-you're right! There's a path that's uniquely yours, Johanna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やあやあみんな。イザナの話はもう聞いたかな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hello everyone. Have you all heard about Izana's news?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "に、睨んでもダメだよ？\n君の結果は変わらないからね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "G-glaring at me won't change anything, you know? Your results are final."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "分かってるわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I know that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシの合格はみんなにもう話したよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I already told everyone about me passing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それは良かった。\nさて、そんなイザナに話があるんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's good. Now, I have something to discuss with you, Izana."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "君の今後の配置についての話だよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's about your future assignment."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "リヒャルト・ランターナの名をもって\n騎士イザナに命ずる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "By the authority of Richard Lantarna, I hereby command Knight Izana."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "錬金術士レスナに付き従い、\n彼女の警護を行う任を与える。以上",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You are to accompany and protect the alchemist Resna. That is all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……いいの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Is that really okay?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ。今やレスナは王国にとって\nなくてはならない存在だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. Resna has become an indispensable asset to the kingdom."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんなレスナを守ることは、国を守ることにも繋がる。\n君にしかできないことだ。これは皆の総意だよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Protecting her is equivalent to protecting the country. It's something only you can do. Everyone agrees on this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ありがとう、ロマン君！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Thank you, Roman!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よかったよお、これからもイザナちゃんと一緒に\n居られるんだね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm so happy! We get to stay together, Izana!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！\u3000本当に良かった！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! I'm really happy too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それに、ごめんね。\n約束、すっごい待たせちゃった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And I'm sorry. I made you wait so long for our promise."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ううん、そんなことないよ。\n叶えてくれるだけで幸せなんだから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, that's not true at all. I'm just happy that you fulfilled it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "改めて……約束、レスナちゃん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Once again... I promise you, Resna..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシは騎士として、レスナちゃんを守り続けることを\n誓います！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "As a knight, I swear to protect you always!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私も……錬金術士として、みんなを幸せにすることを\n誓います！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And I... as an alchemist, I swear to bring happiness to everyone!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（こうして、アタシはレスナちゃんとの約束を\n\u3000果たして、新たな約束を結んだ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(And so, I fulfilled my promise to Resna, and made a new one.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（きっと、こうやってレスナちゃんとは約束を\n\u3000結び続けていくんだと思う）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I think we'll keep making promises to each other like this.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（いつまでも、ずっと――）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Forever and ever—)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えへへー、見て見てこの騎士の服！\nユナさんにもらったんだー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehehe, look at this knight's uniform! Juna gave it to me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おお……かっこいい！\u3000これが騎士の風格……！\nそれに髪も切ったんだ。すごく大人っぽくなったね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow... it looks so cool! That's the dignity of a knight...! And you cut your hair too. You look so much more mature now!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]